## 7. Preventing recurrence

1. Treat every **normative section** as testable, not just the numbered AC list; build the requirement-to-test matrix before declaring done.
2. Add contract tests asserting the **UI/data path exists**, not merely that a payload field exists.
3. Test **both boundaries** of threshold logic (empty/header-only stay valid; one torn row stays a warning).
4. Route display formatting (streaks) through a single shared helper so wording rules can't be missed at one call site.
